NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/conversation.Store.Append kind=method
  digest=b3:c0b8ce70ba5b855c16e7784f6df119311cc5963ff3b5265fb8a5494ee254cf0c file=neo/internal/conversation/store.go range=344:375 lang=go exported=true byte_range=11353:12547
  sig=func (s *Store) Append(convID string, turn Turn)
  doc=Append records one turn and persists it as a single JSONL line append (O(1) in\nthe turn size — no full-file rewrite). Best-effort: IO errors are logged,\nnever fatal. A blank conversation id or text is ignored. When the hot set\nexceeds the retained-turn cap, the overflow rolls to the durable archive\n(rename-based atomic write) — turns are NOT dropped. Crash-atomic: each turn\nis one atomic line append; a torn final line is skipped on load.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/conversation.Store
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/conversation/store.go

